    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every enemy is a boss. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From ground-shaking robots to monsters and demons, each of them are uniquely brutal. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And so are you. </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224540/extras/866b052d8f8afcf264a2d4b9c7593d62.poster.avif?t=1754186125\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224540/extras/866b052d8f8afcf264a2d4b9c7593d62.webm?t=1754186125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224540/extras/866b052d8f8afcf264a2d4b9c7593d62.mp4?t=1754186125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>VOIDFACE</strong>, you face off in a challenging bullet-hell arena shooter to try and clear bite-sized boss rush challenges. Learn to dodge their attacks, cast spells to gain an upper hand, and kill everything that gets in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 unique bosses, across 9 stages  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy and hard mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One hit, and you're dead (2 hp on Easy)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various defensive and offensive spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized, smooth-rendered pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive soundtrack for each stage</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every enemy is a boss. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From ground-shaking robots to monsters and demons, each of them are uniquely brutal. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And so are you. </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224540/extras/866b052d8f8afcf264a2d4b9c7593d62.poster.avif?t=1754186125\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224540/extras/866b052d8f8afcf264a2d4b9c7593d62.webm?t=1754186125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224540/extras/866b052d8f8afcf264a2d4b9c7593d62.mp4?t=1754186125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>VOIDFACE</strong>, you face off in a challenging bullet-hell arena shooter to try and clear bite-sized boss rush challenges. Learn to dodge their attacks, cast spells to gain an upper hand, and kill everything that gets in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 unique bosses, across 9 stages  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy and hard mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One hit, and you're dead (2 hp on Easy)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various defensive and offensive spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized, smooth-rendered pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive soundtrack for each stage</p></li></ul>",
